Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:10.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Now, draw your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.12,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a fair duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:17.04,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh... Did I do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.83,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Please stop feigning innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.38,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Fifty-six incidents of violence \Nwith other warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.48,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Twenty cases of destroying property.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:27.45,main,Miria,0,0,0,,It's only been a month since\Nwe returned from the Great Ravine...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:28.80,main,Miria,0,0,0,,However did you manage all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.29,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yo, I think she's trying to sound like Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:33.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And she sucks at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:36.71,main,Fate,0,0,0,,These were all cases \Nwhere someone came at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.27,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Sucks being popular, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.61,0:00:44.37,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Regardless, I can't overlook \Nany further violent disputes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:46.23,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.19,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Join the royal army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:54.58,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Once you do, even the rowdier warriors \Nwill be reluctant to cause trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:59.63,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I appreciate the concern, \Nbut I'm not much of a follower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:02.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Gotta have our freedom, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:07.06,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I had anticipated that kind of response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:10.01,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,If you intend to refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:14.47,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,then you'll need to reflect \Non your actions in a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:18.04,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:26.17,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Leaving it in the scabbard? \NDon't be upset if it breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:28.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's specially made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:31.95,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I have no intention of holding back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:19.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:22.60,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400)\blur1\c&H0E00DD&\pos(473.437,285)}Death March
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:23.01,italicstop,Fate,0,0,0,,I should have the edge in terms of stats, \Nbut I can't overpower her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:25.56,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's a holy knight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:31.27,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I told you, I don't intend on holding back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.11,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,This is the kind of technical skill \Nyou get with daily training...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:39.62,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Lost in thought in the midst of battle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:43.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Aiming for the mask?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:48.54,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,If you won't take this seriously, \NI'll expose you... literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:49.42,top,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:52.23,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, go go, Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:55.28,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:56.59,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Is that Physical Boost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.51,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You can't win if all you do is dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:05.47,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,If you don't want to reveal who you are, \Nthen please, take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:08.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If that's what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:12.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then I'll have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:14.23,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:17.60,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,That power... it's the Holy \NSword Technique skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:19.71,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,How can you use it without a holy sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:23.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I told you: This scabbard is specially made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:27.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's actually a weapon add-on \Nthat improves Holy Sword Techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:30.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,made from the magic crystal \NI gathered at the Great Ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.33,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,If you have the skill \Nto wield arts in that fashion...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:37.63,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Are you a former holy knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:40.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:44.23,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm not the same person, anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:49.18,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm just a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:00.49,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy's gonna lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now I win—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.74,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's... from the gemstone...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:18.06,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hey! Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:23.89,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You were open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.97,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You total dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:30.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:37.98,main,Miria,0,0,0,,As if Lady Roxy could ever lose \Nto that boneheaded bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:40.88,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly ease up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.85,0:05:44.45,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:47.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Give me a break. Haven't you done enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:48.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's time that I—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.20,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Your swordplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:55.11,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,The way you fight... did you \Nlearn that from Sir Aaron?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:06:00.39,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I was instructed by him during \Nmy journey here, so I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:04.47,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,The way you strike and your \Nfootwork remind me of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.35,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Sir Aaron said...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:10.40,flashback,Aaron,0,0,0,,After meeting a traveler \Nwho was headed to Galia,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:13.38,flashback,Aaron,0,0,0,,I decided to take up the sword once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:20.86,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,And he said that this traveler had a power \Nthat was so great as to cause him difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:24.48,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,If that's you, I'd like to—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:28.33,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Even if it was me, it's my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:33.56,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You need to focus on being able \Nto protect yourself in Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:43.40,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy... you've always \Nbeen so kind, and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:47.09,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Even with a threat to your life \Ndrawing closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:49.31,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,You're still worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:53.49,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,That was really impressive,\Nconsidering you were fighting Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:06:55.71,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Mugan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:57.69,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,No wonder you can slay a chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:01.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It was being controlled by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.18,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,You think so too, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:08.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It had the same emblem as the salamanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:10.61,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Is Eris behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:14.25,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Afterwards, I got a good look \Nat the chimera...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:18.16,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Pretty wild thinking\Nto use a monster as the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:22.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you could figure out \Nthat much just from looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:27.10,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,My family has studied lost Galian \Ntechnology for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:30.97,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,My late father was, and my \Ndaughter is, a gifted scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.43,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Great, a doting dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:35.27,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,She's nothing like me! Really clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:39.51,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The chimera are artificial monsters \Nmade with Galian technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:42.90,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It might be a good idea to have \Nyour daughter examine one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:45.11,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,You trying to say you\N want me to introduce you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.32,main,Fate,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:51.53,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,You don't get to meet Raine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:54.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Seriously! That's not what \NI was trying to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:56.60,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,What did you mean, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:58.57,top,Fate,0,0,0,,It was just a suggestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:59.56,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This guy's less a doting dad \Nand more a plain old dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:04.84,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,Say, Raine, did you hear about Rafale?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:08.75,main,Raine,0,0,0,,There's something going on \Nwith the Vlerick heir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:12.80,main,Raine,0,0,0,,Did Hado dying drive him nuts or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.46,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,That might be part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:18.93,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,The rumors say he's locked himself in his \Nroom, studying the philosopher's stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:21.31,main,Raine,0,0,0,,The philosopher's stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.93,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,He got his hands on it in Tenbern, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:27.66,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,He went on a research trip there\N before Hado died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.99,main,Raine,0,0,0,,The philosopher's stone...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:33.95,main,Raine,0,0,0,,The philosopher's stone... here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:38.86,main,Raine,0,0,0,,It can supposedly heal any wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.17,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:44.23,main,Raine,0,0,0,,It can also grant its owner great strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.42,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,Power?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:50.29,main,Raine,0,0,0,,But in exchange, it dominates the mind \Nand body of the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:51.59,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.14,main,Raine,0,0,0,,Mind-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.65,0:08:57.23,main,Coworker,0,0,0,,What do you suppose he's planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.28,main,Raine,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:08.13,flashback italics,Myne,0,0,0,,The Domain of E. \NThat's what you should aim for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:10.49,flashback italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What's the Domain of E?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:13.00,flashback,Myne,0,0,0,,It's the level of power\N that the Divine Dragon is at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:17.44,flashback,Myne,0,0,0,,If you can't make it there, \Nyou won't be able to fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:22.00,flashback,Myne,0,0,0,,But if you push too hard, your skill will \Noverwhelm you, and you'll lose control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:26.21,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How am I going to get that strong...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:34.72,main,Warriors,0,0,0,,That alarm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:37.72,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:42.39,main,Northern,0,0,0,,There's a massive stampede... \Na death march underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:48.94,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We'll move to intercept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:02.74,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We march to Galia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:06.55,main,Villagers,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So that's a death march.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:22.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The royal army...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:28.79,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You gonna play hero again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:32.71,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If it's just the death march,\NLady Roxy should be able to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.21,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Going into a half-starved state, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:42.00,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You've got a better handle on it than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:45.07,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We'll want to be ready to move at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:46.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We need to figure out \Nwhat's going on and end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:50.82,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What's going on, huh? Don't think \Nwe'll be waiting long, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:51.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:55.60,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Something's approaching \Nthe royal army from the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.37,0:10:58.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't see anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is it underground?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.67,0:11:05.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's moving through ground \Nthe way a whale swims.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.01,0:11:06.77,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Seems like a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:10.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If it keeps on that path, it'll be \Nright beneath the royal army soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:14.64,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Roxy and the others are \Nfocused on the death march.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:17.95,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They'll be in big trouble if they're \Nhit with a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit... Greed, you know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:21.16,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:25.87,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The same way Aaron was able to surpass \Nhis limits thanks to the Gluttony skill...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:31.84,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can use Gluttony to amplify the charged \Nshot, and give it twice as much range!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:36.56,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,A modified art, only \Nusable in half-starvation status,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:38.60,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Charged Shot Spiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.68,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Boosting the range and penetration, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:47.81,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:51.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't always rely on the secret \Ntechniques with how pricey they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.48,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:58.61,main,Fate,0,0,0,,See that?! I caught a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:00.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That emblem!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:02.87,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's the same one from before...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:05.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This time we're gonna \Nfind out what's behind it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:12.13,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What's with you? Why the laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:18.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I was just thinking... the old me would've \Nnever thought of jumping from so high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:20.09,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What're you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:23.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Time to tell me who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.48,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)\an8\pos(312.458,2.814)}Violator of the Ground \NOmega Slime
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.48,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(135.456,124.344)}[Stats]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.48,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(135.456,151.778)}Vitality:
