Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.48,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(453.906,295.988)\an7\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)}Corrosion, \NStamina Boost (Large)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A Crowned beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:31.34,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Its stamina, magic, and spirit \Nare all over ten million.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:34.70,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Even a holy knight would be \Non their back foot against this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.37,0:12:37.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Switch me to the magic shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:44.36,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:45.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Strong acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:47.07,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's raining acid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:49.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And it smells awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:53.72,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Corrosion magic can add corrosive \Neffects to physical attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.07,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So a blend of acid and corrosion magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:59.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It must've been using this to dissolve \Nthe ground to swim through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:03.18,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You'll be dead if it touches you. \NWatch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:05.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We won't be able to \Nfight up close at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:08.90,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And if you slice it up,\N and it sprays that acid everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:11.90,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,it'll melt even your bones into a sludge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Seriously, quit trying to gross me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:16.94,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well, what're you gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:19.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Take your 10%!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:23.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And then we'll add a fire \Nenchantment to the secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.79,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's evaporate him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:30.64,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Did that do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:32.62,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:44.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How'd it even pull that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:48.16,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It split up and continued the attack. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:52.48,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It protected itself from my secret \Ntechnique with one of its offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:56.23,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's headed towards the royal army!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.38,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hold it—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.35,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:01.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,They're trying to slow me down...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:03.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Grand Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:10.81,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It looked like they were ignoring you, \Ndespite how tasty a snack you'd be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:13.25,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,but it was actually a feint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Not the kind of move a monster would pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.94,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's only got one core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:24.50,main,Fate,0,0,0,,After moving underground, it's going to\N have to surface at this crevice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:29.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,When it shows itself, I'll take aim \Nand smash the core!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:33.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed! Take 20%!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:35.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And then add this, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:42.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A Charged Shot Spiral Bloody Ptarmigan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.39,0:14:45.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Seriously...?! You really wanna try this \Nwithout any practice first?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:49.25,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It should be able to pass through \Nany decoys and reach the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.94,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And I bet you can manage to control it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:54.13,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:59.26,main,Fate,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:08.33,italicstop,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.33,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What was that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:17.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What's going on here? I took its soul, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:19.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why is it still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:29.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A perception-altering mask, like mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:31.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is it Eris? That damned copycat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's see your face, Eris!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:42.13,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's a Weapon of Mortal Sin! \NThe Black Gun-Sword, Envy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:46.52,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That makes it pretty likely \Nthat's Eris holding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:53.39,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:56.74,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You saw how the slime was hit \Nwith something before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:16:00.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It was some kind of magic bullet \Nthat draws out latent power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's why it's still alive without a core?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:03.99,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:07.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The core itself became capable \Nof splitting up, which it did to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:13.08,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,An enemy capable of infinite replication... \Nmakes a terrible match for you, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:17.75,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Here it comes, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.49,0:16:24.16,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate... did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:34.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Holding your breath isn't fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:39.84,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The Omega Slime's corrosion magic... \Nyou already figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:41.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm fighting like a glutton, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:44.16,italicstop,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:45.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I was just thinking I hadn't eaten enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:46.57,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:49.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The slimes won't be a match for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:54.03,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If your stats spike too suddenly, \Nit can drive your skill into overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:55.99,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Before that happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:58.00,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm taking Eris down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:01.99,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Deflected?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:03.96,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Take a look at your stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:07.34,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You've gone as far as a human can.
