Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.34,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(321.38,307.844)}Corrosion
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:11.24,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You'd need to reach inhuman heights... \Nthe Domain of E to go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:13.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then my attacks didn't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:16.83,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Because someone who's made it \Ninto the Domain of E
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:20.13,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,would be immune to anyone else's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:23.65,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:31.49,main,Man in Black,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:32.95,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,It's not Eris?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:56.30,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,He's... so much stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:02.73,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But I can't afford to wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:07.90,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I need to be ready to kill... \Nand ready to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:12.57,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,No matter what the price is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:15.40,main,Man in Black,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.52,0:18:17.99,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.45,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Give me the power I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.61,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:34.63,main,Man in Black,0,0,0,,This power... it can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.59,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The Domain of E...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:39.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I owe you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:43.52,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If I hadn't run into you, \NI wouldn't have made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:45.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:53.61,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I can see his shots clearly now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:04.41,main,Man in Black,0,0,0,,A smokescreen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:19.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Northern?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:23.35,main,Northern,0,0,0,,You're half right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:25.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Half right? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:28.23,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.81,0:19:31.91,main,Northern,0,0,0,,But I'm more cautious than Eris is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:35.65,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A flute? What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:39.13,main,Northern,0,0,0,,You'll see soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Divine Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:52.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate, it's heading westward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:54.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:57.63,main,Northern,0,0,0,,Probably only needs another 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:58.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:03.24,main,Northern,0,0,0,,And now the Divine Dragon and I will \Ngive everything we have to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:06.81,main,Northern,0,0,0,,So let's see you give everything to stop us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:11.80,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate, in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:13.90,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A wall of slimes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:15.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,He's obviously trying to buy time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:17.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit, I need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.09,0:20:30.12,main,Soldier C,0,0,0,,What is that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.54,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,The Divine Dragon! All of you, get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:36.59,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.90,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Lend me your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.75,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:22.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
